sequenceDiagram
    participant H as Host application
    participant Q as Command queue
    participant R as Reader kernel
    participant C as Compute kernel
    participant W as Writer kernel

    H->>H: Open device and allocate buffers
    H->>H: Create program, CBs, kernels, runtime args
    H->>Q: Enqueue transfers and program
    Q->>R: Dispatch
    R->>C: Tiles available in input CB
    C->>W: Result tiles available in output CB
    W-->>Q: Output written
    Q-->>H: Completion / readback
